<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>Description</key>
	<string>Downloads the UVIT Hub macOS client from the EigerCode release repo and imports it into Munki.

The pkginfo version is set from the release tag rather than taken from the package, so that each release is a distinct catalog item. See the internal deployment notes for the rationale and for the build-side change that will let this be simplified.

Keep this in the 'test' ring until a build has been proven on real machines.</string>
	<key>Identifier</key>
	<string>com.github.mikeknight85.recipes.munki.UVITHub</string>
	<key>Input</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NAME</key>
		<string>UVITHub</string>
		<key>MUNKI_REPO_SUBDIR</key>
		<string>EigerCode/UVITHub</string>
		<key>pkginfo</key>
		<dict>
			<key>catalogs</key>
			<array>
				<string>testing</string>
			</array>
			<key>description</key>
			<string>The UVIT Hub client for macOS — manages software installation and inventory on this Mac.</string>
			<key>developer</key>
			<string>EigerCode</string>
			<key>display_name</key>
			<string>UVIT Hub</string>
			<key>name</key>
			<string>%NAME%</string>
			<key>unattended_install</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>MinimumVersion</key>
	<string>2.3</string>
	<key>ParentRecipe</key>
	<string>com.github.mikeknight85.recipes.download.UVITHub</string>
	<key>Process</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>Comment</key>
			<string>Merge the tag-derived version into the pkginfo. MunkiImporter has no additional_pkginfo of its own — it reads the merged %pkginfo% from the environment — so the merge has to happen in its own step first. Without this the version would come from the package, which is upstream Munki's 7.2.0.5787 for every build.</string>
			<key>Arguments</key>
			<dict>
				<key>additional_pkginfo</key>
				<dict>
					<key>version</key>
					<string>%version%</string>
				</dict>
			</dict>
			<key>Processor</key>
			<string>MunkiPkginfoMerger</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Arguments</key>
			<dict>
				<key>pkg_path</key>
				<string>%pathname%</string>
				<key>repo_subdirectory</key>
				<string>%MUNKI_REPO_SUBDIR%</string>
			</dict>
			<key>Processor</key>
			<string>MunkiImporter</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
